nexus-live: protocol provenance

The WebRTC session shape used here (an Opus audio track plus the "oai-events"
data channel, a non-trickle SDP offer, half-duplex echo gating) was observed
from how Codex's realtime voice feature behaves, as documented and implemented
in two reference integrations that were read, not run:

  - malhashemi/opencode-gpt-live, commit c23101cf
  - can1357/oh-my-pi, commit 818dd42b

No code was copied from either repository; this crate is an independent
implementation. The OpenAI realtime/Codex voice protocol is undocumented and
may change without notice. nexus-live holds no credentials and talks only to
the WebRTC peer described by the SDP it is given.
